{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14123","headline":"桂州腊夜 · 戎昱","name":"桂州腊夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐到三更尽，归仍万里赊。\n雪声偏傍竹，寒梦不离家。\n晓角分残漏，孤灯落碎花。\n二年随骠骑，辛苦向天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「桂州腊夜」条，撰者滕伟明、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"滕伟明"}